<main class="Layout-module__content___wEYFD" id="content"><header class="CommitmentsHeader-module__root___Cdvuv" data-variant="home"><p class="Eyebrow-module__root___gdMQw">Our commitments</p><h1 class="Heading-module__root___NpBjo CommitmentsHeader-module__title___rncEH" data-font-size="lg">Offering <em>the most natural products</em> while <em>minimizing our environmental impact</em></h1></header><div class="CommitmentsIntro-module__root___4FQv8"><div class="TextContainer-module__root___3x88v CommitmentsIntro-module__text___K0Q-O"><h2 class="Heading-module__root___NpBjo" data-font-size="sm" id="we-are-two-pharmacists-with-a-passion-for-cosmetology-and-natural-beauty">We are two pharmacists with a passion for cosmetology and natural beauty.</h2><p>Behind the pharmacy counter, we connected with women and men who were looking for a simpler, truly honest, and more responsible offer. Free from superfluous and unkept promises.</p><p>We wanted to create products with up to 100% natural origin for everyone, featuring simplified formulas that are effective and offer an incomparable sensory experience.</p><p>La Rosée was born as a transparent, committed brand that you can trust completely!</p></div><ul class="CommitmentsIntro-module__signatures___0dLHu"><li><img srcSet="https://larosee.twic.pics/1316x242/f2c0e6c474/signature-coline-mahault-fondatrices-de-la-rosee.png/m/1316x242?twic=v1/quality=100/resize=204 1x, https://larosee.twic.pics/1316x242/f2c0e6c474/signature-coline-mahault-fondatrices-de-la-rosee.png/m/1316x242?twic=v1/quality=80/resize=408 2x, https://larosee.twic.pics/1316x242/f2c0e6c474/signature-coline-mahault-fondatrices-de-la-rosee.png/m/1316x242?twic=v1/quality=66/resize=612 3x" src="https://larosee.twic.pics/1316x242/f2c0e6c474/signature-coline-mahault-fondatrices-de-la-rosee.png/m/1316x242" width="1316" height="242" sizes="204px" alt="Signature Coline &amp; Mahault, fondatrices de La Rosée" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></li></ul><img class="CommitmentsI